# Audited Phase 2B supersession evidence is intentionally committed.  The
# package verifier rejects an ignored manifest/checksum entry, so a future
# packaging run cannot recreate the historical omitted-log defect.
!docs/audits/v49-phase2b-evidence-amendment/
!docs/audits/v49-phase2b-evidence-amendment/**

# Formal repository-closure logs are checksum-covered evidence, not local
# runtime.  Keep this exception narrower than the global *.log policy.
!docs/audits/v49-repository-hygiene-and-database-freeze/
!docs/audits/v49-repository-hygiene-and-database-freeze/**

